  "reviewed_runtime_boundaries": [
    "World 8 difficulties use direct public level 56, 72, 81 and 90 values; no interpolation is used.",
    "Swallow Return creates four owner-scaled, targetable Flying Swords at formation positions 1, 2, 4 and 5, each with one deterministic random true weakness.",
    "Sword Formation protects Yanqing's toughness and grants 60 flat SPD while at least one Flying Sword survives; destroying all swords removes it and consumes 20% of Yanqing's maximum HP.",
    "Chilling Light is a permanent stack shared by Yanqing and all surviving swords, contributing 10% ordinary damage per stack.",
    "Phase three deterministically selects one Ordeal sword from each source pair; Ordeal doubles sword toughness from 30 to 60 and adds a resistible one-turn Freeze after its attack.",
    "Freeze blocks the target's normal action and deals 120% of the applier's ATK as delayed Ice damage at target-turn start.",
    "Qi Converge marks one opponent, and Aethereal Dreamflux deals 300% ATK Ice damage plus another 300% for every surviving sword before despawning all swords without the formation-collapse HP penalty.",
    "The three phase graphs, damage, summon lifecycle, random weakness, toughness protection, control and formation-collapse rules use shared Rule IR without a native handler."
  ]
